# Repository recovery manifest consumed by `reseed`.
# One Git URL per line. Existing directories under ~/src are preserved.
# Keep the canonical copy in a remote/private repo if this list matters after
# device loss; /mnt/shared only survives AVF resets, not a phone wipe/loss.
#
# git@github.com:example/private-project.git
# https://github.com/example/public-project.git
